## Related success criteria

* [1.4.2 Audio Control (A)](https://alphagov.github.io/guide-to-wcag/sc/1.4.2.html) is another non-interference criterion which requires that autoplaying audio can be controlled or stopped.
* [2.2.2 Pause, Stop, Hide (A)](https://alphagov.github.io/guide-to-wcag/sc/2.2.2.html) is another non-interference criterion which requires a way to stop content that updates frequently, blinks or scrolls automatically.

